280
00:12:53,410 --> 00:12:57,200
For small, isolated populations alive
today, recovery

281
00:12:57,200 --> 00:13:00,160
can be encouraging without erasing every
genetic

282
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:02,560
risk. For the Wrangel mammoths, we know

283
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:04,450
more about the long journey than the

284
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:06,940
final moment. The last question is not

285
00:13:06,940 --> 00:13:08,150
